#. type: Title #
#: docs/sap/overview.md:1 docs/sap/overview.md:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "SAP Overview"
msgstr "SAP 概述"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/overview.md:8
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "**SAP** (Satellite Application Protocol, version `SAP/1.0`) is the WebSocket JSON protocol between the FreeAnima **Hub** (`anima service`) and **Satellite** processes. Satellites are standalone apps (Parlor, pair-programming Studio) that expose their own HTTP UI while delegating agent runtime to the Hub.\n"
msgid "**SAP** (Satellite Application Protocol, version `SAP/1.0`) is the WebSocket JSON protocol between the FreeAnima **Hub** (`anima service`) and **Satellite** processes. Satellites are standalone apps (e.g. Chat) that expose their own HTTP UI while delegating agent runtime to the Hub.\n"
msgstr "**SAP**（Satellite Application Protocol，版本 `SAP/1.0`）是 FreeAnima **Hub**（`anima service`）与 **Satellite** 进程之间的 WebSocket JSON 协议。Satellite 是独立应用（聊天室、结对编程管理台），提供各自的 HTTP UI，同时将 agent 运行时委托给 Hub。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/overview.md:10
msgid ""
"Schemas and client SDK live in [`packages/sap-contract/`](../../packages/sap-"
"contract/). Hub server implementation: [`platform/src/sap/`](../../platform/"
"src/sap/)."
msgstr ""
"Schema 与客户端 SDK 位于 [`packages/sap-contract/`](../../packages/sap-"
"contract/)。Hub 服务端实现：[`platform/src/sap/`](../../platform/src/sap/)。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/sap/overview.md:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Design goals"
msgstr "设计目标"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/overview.md:16
msgid ""
"**One Hub WS per instance**: each satellite instance opens exactly one `/sap/"
"v1` connection to the Hub (multiplex conversations, streams, tools)."
msgstr ""
"**每个实例一条 Hub WS**：每个 satellite 实例仅向 Hub 打开一条 `/sap/v1` 连接"
"（多路复用会话、流与工具）。"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/overview.md:16
msgid ""
"**Origin isolation**: bundled clients may use browser-direct Hub WS (`sap-"
"direct`) or a local SAP relay (`/sap/relay/v1`) depending on deployment."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/overview.md:16
msgid ""
"**Shared contract**: both sides import `@freeanima/sap-contract` for "
"envelopes, RPC types, `runSapTransport`, `createSapBrowserClient`, and "
"`createSapRelayBrowserClient`."
msgstr ""
"**共享契约**：双方从 `@freeanima/sap-contract` 导入信封、RPC 类型、"
"`runSapTransport`、`createSapBrowserClient` 与 "
"`createSapRelayBrowserClient`。"

