#. type: Title ##
#: docs/sap/overview.md:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "End-to-end happy path"
msgstr "端到端正常路径"

#. type: Fenced code block (mermaid)
#: docs/sap/overview.md:40
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"sequenceDiagram\n"
"  participant Sat as Satellite process\n"
"  participant Hub as Hub\n"
"  participant Agent as AgentRuntime\n"
"\n"
"  Sat->>Hub: connect\n"
"  Hub->>Sat: connected\n"
"  Sat->>Hub: req tool.register\n"
"  Hub->>Sat: res ok\n"
"  Sat->>Hub: req conversation.create\n"
"  Hub->>Sat: res conversation_id\n"
"  Sat->>Hub: req message.send\n"
"  Hub->>Sat: res stream_id\n"
"  Hub-->>Sat: evt stream.accepted\n"
"  Hub-->>Sat: evt stream.token\n"
"  Agent->>Hub: invoke sap tool\n"
"  Hub-->>Sat: evt tool.call\n"
"  Sat->>Hub: req tool.result\n"
"  Hub-->>Sat: evt stream.tool_result\n"
"  Hub-->>Sat: evt stream.done\n"
msgstr ""
"sequenceDiagram\n"
"  participant Sat as Satellite process\n"
"  participant Hub as Hub\n"
"  participant Agent as AgentRuntime\n"
"\n"
"  Sat->>Hub: connect\n"
"  Hub->>Sat: connected\n"
"  Sat->>Hub: req tool.register\n"
"  Hub->>Sat: res ok\n"
"  Sat->>Hub: req conversation.create\n"
"  Hub->>Sat: res conversation_id\n"
"  Sat->>Hub: req message.send\n"
"  Hub->>Sat: res stream_id\n"
"  Hub-->>Sat: evt stream.accepted\n"
"  Hub-->>Sat: evt stream.token\n"
"  Agent->>Hub: invoke sap tool\n"
"  Hub-->>Sat: evt tool.call\n"
"  Sat->>Hub: req tool.result\n"
"  Hub-->>Sat: evt stream.tool_result\n"
"  Hub-->>Sat: evt stream.done\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: docs/sap/overview.md:68
msgid "Satellite process opens `ws://{hub}/sap/v1` and sends `connect`."
msgstr "Satellite 进程打开 `ws://{hub}/sap/v1` 并发送 `connect`。"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: docs/sap/overview.md:68
msgid ""
"Hub replies `connected` and registers the instance in `SatelliteManager`."
msgstr "Hub 回复 `connected`，并在 `SatelliteManager` 中注册该实例。"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: docs/sap/overview.md:68
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Satellite registers local tools via `tool.register`."
msgid "Satellite registers local tools via `tool.register` (if any)."
msgstr "Satellite 通过 `tool.register` 注册本地工具。"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#: docs/sap/overview.md:68
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "`message.send` returns a `stream_id`; Hub pushes `stream.*` events (fan-"
#| "out on relay)."
msgid "`message.send` returns a `stream_id`; Hub pushes `stream.*` events."
msgstr ""
"`message.send` 返回 `stream_id`；Hub 推送 `stream.*` 事件（在中继上分发给各客"
"户端）。"

#. type: Bullet: '5. '
#: docs/sap/overview.md:68
msgid ""
"When the agent calls a Satellite tool, Hub sends `tool.call`; Satellite "
"replies with `tool.result` or `tool.error`."
msgstr ""
"当 agent 调用 Satellite 工具时，Hub 发送 `tool.call`；Satellite 以 "
"`tool.result` 或 `tool.error` 回复。"

